  "body": "Currently CanvasRenderingContext2D has many methods which make it unusable in other places, for example:\n- Back-reference to the canvas element\n- DOM based apis\n\nThis splits up the CanvasRenderingContext2D into multiple sub-interfaces so that portions can be used by OffscreenCanvas[1] and CSS Paint API [2].\n\n[1] https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/OffscreenCanvas\n[2] https://drafts.css-houdini.org/css-paint-api/\n",
